# Snowflake SQL Validator Project Structure

## Core Architecture

This is a high-performance TypeScript library for validating Snowflake SQL queries with case-insensitive keyword support. The project uses ANTLR4 grammar parsing with custom validation rules and advanced performance optimizations.

## Main Entry Points

- [src/index.ts](mdc:src/index.ts) - Main exports and public API functions
- [src/SnowflakeSQL.ts](mdc:src/SnowflakeSQL.ts) - Core parser class with performance optimizations
- [src/CaseInsensitiveSnowflakeLexer.ts](mdc:src/CaseInsensitiveSnowflakeLexer.ts) - Case-insensitive lexer implementation
- [src/PerformanceOptimizer.ts](mdc:src/PerformanceOptimizer.ts) - Performance optimization utilities
- [src/SnowflakeValidationVisitor.ts](mdc:src/SnowflakeValidationVisitor.ts) - Custom validation visitor

## ANTLR4 Parser Files

The [src/parser/snowflake/](mdc:src/parser/snowflake/) directory contains generated ANTLR4 files:
- [SnowflakeLexer.ts](mdc:src/parser/snowflake/SnowflakeLexer.ts) - Generated lexer
- [SnowflakeParser.ts](mdc:src/parser/snowflake/SnowflakeParser.ts) - Generated parser
- [SnowflakeLexer.g4](mdc:src/parser/snowflake/SnowflakeLexer.g4) - Lexer grammar definition
- [SnowflakeParser.g4](mdc:src/parser/snowflake/SnowflakeParser.g4) - Parser grammar definition

## Key Features

- **Performance**: 96%+ performance improvement with caching for repeated queries
- **Case-Insensitive**: Automatically handles `select`, `SELECT`, and rejects `sElEcT`
- **TypeScript**: Full TypeScript definitions included
- **React Compatible**: Can be imported and used in React applications
- **Smart Caching**: LRU cache management with configurable limits

## Build Configuration

- [package.json](mdc:package.json) - Project configuration and scripts
- [tsconfig.json](mdc:tsconfig.json) - TypeScript configuration
- [jest.config.js](mdc:jest.config.js) - Test configuration

## Testing

- [src/__tests__/](mdc:src/__tests__/) - Test files including comprehensive, coverage, and performance tests
